{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:jackwdev@outlook.com\">jackwdev@outlook.com</a></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Feel free to discuss the game, share feedback and report any bugs with me. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your support means a lot :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>* Simplicity in Complexity *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Path to the Void </i>is a Diablolike, gear-driven looter combined with slight roguelike component where you slaughter, level up, and explore endless realms. Crush mighty or grotesque bosses, rapidly assemble your dream build, and revel in hoarder\u2019s euphoria\u2014perfect for a quick session between coffee breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/In_Game.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>* Endless Buildcraft *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ weapons &amp; gear with wild effects (and growing!), paired with massive attribute ranges that test your luck\u2014dominate through sheer numbers or laugh at RNG\u2019s whims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/\u4ed3\u5e93gif\u65b0.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique classes, 6 debuff types \u2013 slaughter mobs your way. Burn them? Poison them? Or why not both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game-breaking synergies defy class stereotypes: <i>Mages</i> can also tank hits like unyielding fortresses and <i>Clerics</i> deliver bone-crushing melee &quot;blessings&quot; to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/\u83b7\u5f97\u88c5\u5907gif\u65b0.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>So, what do you say, my friend? Come and join me!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622670?t=1745308203","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/9c2f7c97763c96efbdd2fcfb3343cc62df98c42b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745308203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/3678c0ae77e16bf28ff9ed1131855d44b058b6a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745308203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/3678c0ae77e16bf28ff9ed1131855d44b058b6a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745308203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:jackwdev@outlook.com\">jackwdev@outlook.com</a></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Feel free to discuss the game, share feedback and report any bugs with me. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your support means a lot :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>* Simplicity in Complexity *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Path to the Void </i>is a Diablolike, gear-driven looter combined with slight roguelike component where you slaughter, level up, and explore endless realms. Crush mighty or grotesque bosses, rapidly assemble your dream build, and revel in hoarder\u2019s euphoria\u2014perfect for a quick session between coffee breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/In_Game.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>* Endless Buildcraft *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ weapons &amp; gear with wild effects (and growing!), paired with massive attribute ranges that test your luck\u2014dominate through sheer numbers or laugh at RNG\u2019s whims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/\u4ed3\u5e93gif\u65b0.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique classes, 6 debuff types \u2013 slaughter mobs your way. Burn them? Poison them? Or why not both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game-breaking synergies defy class stereotypes: <i>Mages</i> can also tank hits like unyielding fortresses and <i>Clerics</i> deliver bone-crushing melee &quot;blessings&quot; to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/\u83b7\u5f97\u88c5\u5907gif\u65b0.gif?t=1745308203\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>So, what do you say, my friend? Come and join me!</i></strong></p>","developers":["JieKe PonHu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/791cde76fd058e880dba863ea163f2311e25eaf7/header.jpg?t=1745308203","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<i>Copyright \u00a9 JieKe PonHu. All Rights Reserved</i>","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123038,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123038/movie480.mp4?t=1744023591","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123038/movie_max.mp4?t=1744023591"},"name":"english","thumbnail":"